{
  "bookId": "hero-213005",
  "id": "bond-28546",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28546001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "喂！小孩儿，你怎么愁眉苦脸的！\n大清早就一副挨过揍的表情，真晦气！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28546002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28546003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "怎么不说话啊，快说，到底是谁要欺负你？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28546004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "有人借钱不还，我要不回来，就很烦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28546005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "什么！竟然有人敢这样对你！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28546006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "他在哪！我这就去把他项上人头拿来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28546007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "！！！你冷静一点！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28546008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "你别拦着我，竟然有人敢欺负你，我要他狗命！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28546009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "就是一点小钱，要不回来就算了，你别这么激动。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28546010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "算了？这怎么能算了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28546011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "你知不知道「君辱臣死」！这钱我一定要给你要回来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28546012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "吕布……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28546013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "唤我何事？有事直说，别支支吾吾的，听着烦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28546014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没，只是没想到你会说出这样的话，有点感动。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28546015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "吕布",
          "text": "那你可得好好记着！等我回来！我要三天三夜的庆功大宴！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
